        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.144,
                0.519,
                0.851,
                0.576
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4、信号 \\(\\delta_T(t) = \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\delta(t-nT)\\) ( \\(n\\) 为整数)的指数函数形式的傅里叶级数可以表示为 \\(\\delta_T(t) = \\sum_{k=-\\infty}^{\\infty} F_k e^{jk\\omega_1 t}\\) (\\(k\\) 为整数)，则下面描述不正确的是(D)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.141,
                0.586,
                0.256,
                0.621
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "A. \\( \\omega_{1}=\\frac{2\\pi}{T} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.522,
                0.586,
                0.624,
                0.62
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "B、 \\( F_{k}=\\frac{1}{T} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.143,
                0.639,
                0.466,
                0.667
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "C、该信号的幅度谱具有偶对称特性",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.678,
                0.422,
                0.811
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.519,
                0.63,
                0.849,
                0.685
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "D、该信号的基波分量是 \\( \\frac{1}{T}\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{T}t\\right) \\) \n(k就是上课讲的n)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.505,
                0.68,
                0.863,
                0.812
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {f _ {k}} & {= \\frac {1}{T _ {1}} f _ {T _ {1}} f (t) e ^ {- j n w _ {1} t} d t} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{T _ {1}} \\int_ {- \\frac {\\pi}{2}} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} d (t) e ^ {- j n w _ {1} t} d t} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{T _ {1}}} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.498,
                0.81,
                0.788,
                0.849
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\( |F_{k}| \\) 知时你 \\( \\varphi_{k} \\) 奇对称",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.467,
                0.855,
                0.864,
                0.946
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{基} B \\stackrel {C _ {1}} {=}} & {\\cos \\omega t = 2 F _ {1} \\cos \\frac {2 \\lambda}{T} t} \\\\ & {= \\frac {2}{T} \\cos \\frac {2 \\lambda}{T} t} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
